# Customer Churn Prediction using Logistic Regression

## Overview
This project builds a Logistic Regression model to predict customer churn using customer demographic and service-related features.

## Dataset
IBM Customer Churn Dataset

## Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib

## Workflow
1. Load dataset
2. Data preprocessing
3. Feature scaling
4. Train/Test split
5. Logistic Regression
6. Model evaluation
7. Feature importance visualization

## Evaluation Metrics
- Accuracy
- Log Loss
- Confusion Matrix
- Classification Report

## Results
The model predicts customer churn and evaluates its performance using standard classification metrics.